  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "33-66",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> FAQ </h1>",
      "body": "<p>Frequently Asked Questions</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c162758",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Can TMS be used on mobile devices such as tablets or smartphones?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Yes, with the device-independent web app, you can access the central tool management system on the go using any web browser, view all production-related information, and make tool reservations.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c164289",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "For which systems can ZOLLER provide interfaces?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>ZOLLER has over 25 CAM and simulation system integrations and can also connect to ERP, MES, and electronic issuance systems, as well as various other relevant systems that have an API.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c164291",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can you use ZOLLER to manage and evaluate tool life?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>ZOLLER provides integrated tool life management and monitoring with comprehensive statistical analysis as needed. Bidirectional tool life data transfer with the machines can, for example, be implemented flexibly and universally using ZOLLER’s »zidCode 4.0« technology.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c164293",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How and where is the tool data stored using the ZOLLER solution?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>With ZOLLER TMS, your company’s manufacturing expertise stays within your organization. ZOLLER uses a database on your own servers that no one else has access to.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c164295",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can I add more functions later?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Yes, thanks to the software’s modular structure, you can start with the features you need today and add additional software modules at any time later on. This way, the system grows with your needs, in line with the motto: Start with a Solution – Enter a System.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c164297",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can data be imported, for example, from the manufacturer or an Excel spreadsheet?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Of course, you can import existing data. You can import not only Excel lists but also digital data – such as tool parameters and 2D and 3D graphics – directly from the manufacturer.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c164301",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What size of company is the ZOLLER TMS designed for?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Thanks to its modularity and scalability, the software can be used cost-effectively for both very small businesses and large-scale production runs.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c164302",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Which processes can be digitized using ZOLLER TMS?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>With ZOLLER TMS, you can digitize the entire production process – from drawing and programming in CAM through inventory management, tool preparation, and tool measurement all the way to the machine and back again. </p> <p>All workstations in the manufacturing process use the same user interface and database. This ensures a seamless manufacturing process with a coordinated system of software and hardware.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c164303",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How does ZOLLER handle updates and support?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Our support team is available to our customers by phone and email at any time and can provide assistance even on short notice.</p> <p>Thanks to our regional application engineering teams at our sales and service branches, we can be on-site promptly when needed.</p> <p>Regular major updates (usually once a year) are installed on-site in collaboration with your IT department. Patch updates can be conveniently downloaded online.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c164305",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What are the options for locking the drawers of the »toolOrganizer«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The drawers can be locked either electronically or mechanically. In addition, the »smartCompartment« feature allows for individual compartment locking.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c162686",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can the layout inside a drawer of the »toolOrganizer« or a pull-out of the »keeper« be customized?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The contents can be customized as desired. The »toolOrganizer« features drawer dividers called »smartCompartment« to help you organize your drawers efficiently. With the »keeper«, you can adjust the height of each level and equip them with the appropriate tool holders from ZOLLER Tooling Solutions.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c162638",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can the Smart Cabinets also be controlled remotely via the network?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Yes, these can also be controlled over the network.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c162590",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c162734",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
